    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: 'Casuality Radius and Kill Radius of each IED can be configured.


    When
    an IED is triggered, buzzer in device will get activated and attached explosive
    will be triggered in 5 seconds.


    A IED can either be triggered from sensor
    attached to it or from control console (when in active state).


    Drag Drop
    to pinpoint position for IED, Disable GPS location'
