    m_Alignment: 3
    m_AlignByGeometry: 0
    m_RichText: 1
    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: 'Whenever an IED triggers, each personnel in the casuality radius will
    be marked injured and in kill radius will be marked dead automatically.



    When
    a person is wounded or killed, buzzer in his device activates.


    A person
    can be categorized as Security Force, Bystander or Anti National Element.'
